  "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says the first four rules are scoped to alarms, but the GT's resource-check rule has no Scope; the scope check covers only the three rules the GT scopes. 'Each input passed through only when non-empty' (Fn::If gating) is not expressible because conditions are resolved at defaults. Real candidates wrap the rules in one AWS::Config::ConformancePack TemplateBody, so rule, scope and input checks also accept that form."
